{"unit_id":"G57651__dsh-diy-layout#card-zh","repo":"G57651/dsh-diy-layout","commit":"8ec43d06d9509d24f5394374078bc93d65c0229f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-diy-layout 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的侧边栏布局插件。它通过设置页、悬浮提示浮层和动态注入的样式，调整全局面板与底部插件区的显示方式。用户可以切换面板单栏或双栏、底部区域横排或多列、图标与名称显示方式，并逐项排序或隐藏入口；图标模式下可悬停查看名称。适合希望整理 DSH 侧边栏、压缩插件入口或按使用习惯排列面板的用户。设置保存在浏览器本地，无需额外配置或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:69-128","src/client/settings-page.tsx:124-204","src/client/store.ts:88-131"]}
{"unit_id":"G57651__dsh-diy-layout#card-en","repo":"G57651/dsh-diy-layout","commit":"8ec43d06d9509d24f5394374078bc93d65c0229f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-diy-layout customizes the DSH web client sidebar. It adds a settings page, a hover tooltip overlay, and dynamic styles for the global panel list and footer plugin row. Choose one or two panel columns, arrange footer entries in a row or columns, switch between icon and label displays, and reorder or hide individual entries. Icon-only mode shows entry names on hover. It suits users who want a more compact or personally organized DSH sidebar. Preferences persist in the browser, with no extra configuration or external service required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:69-128","src/client/settings-page.tsx:124-204","src/client/store.ts:88-131"]}
